The goal of this project is to implement a plugin for jetbrains projects to provide language support for gdb debugger command scripts. Required feature:

1) lexer

after

2) parser
3) syntax highlighting based on tokens
4) documentation provider

Agent should run commands directly e.g. "git add ." "./gradlew test" where possible to facilitate allowlist whitelisting and avoid "bash -lc"
